  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">bridging data, participation and human rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project endeavors to strengthen participatory data collection and monitoring processes through digital data platforms and foster coordination for advancing SDG localization within a human rights-based framework. It addresses the gap of &#x201c;Monitoring: limited data, lack of monitoring and reporting capacities, and little evidence-based analysis&#x201d; as defined by the Local2030 Coalition and focuses on the SDG transition of &#x201c;digital transformation.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
